# CMS Admin Design System

This rule applies **only to the CMS admin panel**. The public website template is customer-specific and not defined yet — do not reuse admin styles for the front-end site.

## Principles

- **Modern, clean, minimal, simple** — reduce visual noise; every element must earn its place.
- Prefer whitespace over borders and decoration.
- One primary action per screen section; secondary actions stay visually quiet.

## Color Palette

| Role | Value | Usage |
|------|-------|-------|
| Primary | `#000000` | Buttons, links, active nav, focus rings, key icons |
| Background | `#FFFFFF` | Page, cards, modals, inputs |
| Surface muted | `#F5F5F5` | Table headers, sidebar hover, subtle dividers |
| Border | `#E5E5E5` | Input borders, card outlines, separators |
| Text primary | `#000000` | Headings, body |
| Text secondary | `#666666` | Labels, hints, metadata |
| Text disabled | `#999999` | Disabled controls |
| Error | `#DC2626` | Validation, destructive confirm |
| Success | `#16A34A` | Success toasts, saved state |

Do not introduce accent colors (blue, brand gradients, etc.) unless explicitly requested.

## Typography (Farsi)

- Set `lang="fa"` and `dir="rtl"` on the admin layout root.
- Font stack: `'Abar Mid Fanum', Tahoma, sans-serif` (variable font, default weight Mid / 500, Farsi digits).
- Base size: `16px`; line-height: `1.6`.
- Headings: semibold/bold via `font-weight` (600–700) — avoid decorative display fonts.
- Use Persian digits in UI copy; keep Latin for code, URLs, and API keys.

## Spacing & Layout

- Base unit: `4px` (use multiples: 8, 12, 16, 24, 32, 48).
- Page padding: `24px` desktop, `16px` mobile.
- Card padding: `16px`–`24px`; border-radius: `6px` max.
- Max content width for forms: `640px`; for data tables: full width with horizontal scroll on small screens.

## Components

### Buttons

```html
<!-- Primary -->
<button class="btn btn-primary">ذخیره</button>

<!-- Secondary (outline) -->
<button class="btn btn-secondary">انصراف</button>

<!-- Ghost -->
<button class="btn btn-ghost">حذف</button>
```

- Primary: black fill, white text, no shadow.
- Secondary: white fill, black border (`1px solid #000`).
- Hover: primary → `#333`; secondary → `#F5F5F5`.
- Min height: `40px`; horizontal padding: `16px`.

### Forms

- Full-width inputs; label above field (RTL-aligned right).
- Focus: `2px solid #000` outline, no glow.
- Error state: red border + Persian error message below field.

### Navigation

- Sidebar or top bar: white background, black text/icons.
- Active item: black background + white text, or black left/right border (use `border-inline-start`).

### Tables

- White rows, `#F5F5F5` header row.
- Row hover: `#FAFAFA`.
- Actions column on the **start** side (right in RTL).

### Feedback

- Toasts: minimal — white card, thin border, black text; success/error icon only.
- Empty states: simple icon + one line of Persian copy + one action button.

## RTL Rules

- Use **logical CSS properties**: `margin-inline-start`, `padding-inline-end`, `inset-inline-start` — never hardcode `left`/`right`.
- Mirror directional icons (chevrons, arrows, back buttons); keep universal icons (check, close, search) unchanged.
- Dropdowns and tooltips open toward the inline-start edge.
- Scrollbars stay on the physical right; do not force scrollbar side.

## Do Not

- Add gradients, glassmorphism, heavy shadows, or colorful themes.
- Use LTR-only layouts or English-only placeholder copy in admin UI.
- Copy admin styles to the public website template.
- Overload screens with cards, badges, or icon-only buttons without labels.

